{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1011718001:0":{"text":"セシア！なぜ攻撃をやめた！？\n力を分け与えたお前が負けるはずないだろう！","source_cn":"瑟西娅，为什么收手？！\\n力量已经分给你，你不可能输！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x184D34D133A64B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011718002:0":{"text":"愚かねぇ……","source_cn":"愚蠢啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF6C055A0CF95D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011718003:0":{"text":"なんだと！？","source_cn":"你说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4954C81085A1291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011718004:0":{"text":"流光の樹の生命力は奪えず、計画は露顕した。","source_cn":"流荧树的生命力无法抽取，计划已然败露。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x896D93269E0CC9AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011718005:0":{"text":"完璧な結果とはならなかったけど、ほしかった力の一部は手に入れたし。","source_cn":"虽然没有完全如愿，渴求的部分力量也已经到手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F7F1E7E50473A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011718006:0":{"text":